* ============================================================================
* cascade_env_regression.dts - AIF-105 Cascade system-bundle environment proof.
*
* Proves (all runtime-proven 2026-08-10 before promotion, per the
* promote-final-tests rule): the systems/cascade_erp bundle stands up from
* its slots; USE auto-attaches the built CDX orders; SET ORDER selects a tag
* and ordered traversal follows it; SEEK reaches a record through the SKU
* unique tag; and the SQLite carrier opens through ERP CASCADE at the bundle
* path.
*
* Read-only: opens bundle tables, mutates nothing, restores the x64 env.
* Run standalone: DO cascade_env_regression | regression: REGRESSION RUN CASCADE_ENV
* Markers: C_G0, C_T1..C_T5 must all print .T.
*
* KNOWN-BEHAVIOR NOTE (measured 2026-08-10): the ITEM_ID tag orders the
* N-type key LEXICOGRAPHICALLY (1,10,11..18,2..9), not numerically. C_T1/T2
* encode that measured behavior on purpose. If numeric key encoding ever
* lands, these two markers will flip -- that is the subject moving, not the
* test failing; repoint them (IDXSTALE precedent). SQLite orders the same
* key numerically, so this is also a recorded behavioral-parity difference
* for the AIF-105 parity oracle (lane gate 3).
*
* Section 2 (C_T6..C_T8, added after the 2026-08-10 runtime proof):
* WORKSPACE LOAD cascade_all restores 43 areas + 58 relations (logical-name
* plane), and SET RELATION traversal follows the parent BY POSITION:
* parent TOP -> REL REFRESH -> child SO_ID reads 1; parent BOTTOM ->
* REL REFRESH -> child SO_ID reads 6 (child recno measured moving 1 -> 11).
* HOUSE SEMANTIC (measured): slaving is REFRESH-DRIVEN -- the child follows
* on REL REFRESH after a parent move, not implicitly per movement (a
* deliberate difference from FoxPro). Requires workspaces/cascade_all.dtschema.
* ============================================================================
SET ECHO OFF
STOP_ON_ERROR OFF

FORMULA "CASCADE-ENV-PROOF-BEGIN"

* --- environment: the bundle slots ------------------------------------------
SET PATH DBF SYSTEMS/CASCADE_ERP/DBF
SET PATH INDEXES SYSTEMS/CASCADE_ERP/INDEXES
SET PATH LMDB SYSTEMS/CASCADE_ERP/LMDB

* --- C_G0: bundle table opens and physical row 1 is the known seed ----------
SELECT 1
USE CASCADE_Items
GOTO 1
? "C_G0_items_row1_is_shaft:" + (ALLTRIM(SKU) = "RAW-SHAFT-4140")

* --- ordered traversal under the ITEM_ID tag (lexicographic, see note) ------
SET ORDER TAG ITEM_ID
TOP
? "C_T1_lex_top_is_item_1:" + (ALLTRIM(SKU) = "RAW-SHAFT-4140")
SKIP
? "C_T2_lex_next_is_item_10:" + (ALLTRIM(SKU) = "PKG-CARTON")
BOTTOM
? "C_T3_lex_bottom_is_item_9:" + (ALLTRIM(SKU) = "RAW-HYD-FIT")

* --- SEEK through the SKU unique tag ----------------------------------------
SET ORDER TAG SKU
SEEK "PDU-100"
* LOGICAL name plane in expressions: DESCRIPTION, not the truncated
* descriptor DESCRIPTIO (first run 2026-08-10: SEEK landed at 14 but the
* descriptor read empty and the marker went .F. -- the two-name-planes
* doctrine catching its own author).
? "C_T4_seek_pdu100_lands:" + (ALLTRIM(DESCRIPTION) = "Precision Drive Unit PDU-100")

* --- second spine: Sales_Orders order attaches and tops at SO 1 -------------
* SO_ID values are 1..6 (single digits), so lexicographic == numeric here and
* TOP under the SO_ID tag is SO 1, whose STATUS was measured CONFIRMED
* (ERP SELECT transcript, 2026-08-10).
SELECT 2
USE CASCADE_Sales_Orders
SET ORDER TAG SO_ID
TOP
? "C_T5_so1_status_confirmed:" + (ALLTRIM(STATUS) = "CONFIRMED")

* --- SQLite carrier: transcript checkpoints (unscored, like VDISK STATUS) ---
* ERP CHECK prints its own 34/9/7/58/26/330 scorecard; the transcript is the
* evidence. A .dts marker cannot read command output (house rule).
ERP CASCADE
ERP CHECK
ERP CLOSE

* === Section 2: the full workspace + relation traversal (proven 2026-08-10) ==
* C_T6: the canonical workspace restores with relations intact
WORKSPACE LOAD cascade_all
SELECT CASCADE_SALES_ORDERS
SET ORDER TAG SO_ID
TOP
REL REFRESH
SELECT CASCADE_SO_LINES
? "C_T6_child_follows_parent_top:" + (SO_ID = 1)
* C_T7: moving the parent re-drives the child (the milestone marker)
SELECT CASCADE_SALES_ORDERS
BOTTOM
REL REFRESH
SELECT CASCADE_SO_LINES
? "C_T7_child_follows_parent_bottom:" + (SO_ID = 6)
* C_T8: the followed child record is real data, not just a position
? "C_T8_child_line_is_order6_line1:" + (SOLINE_ID = 11)

FORMULA "CASCADE-ENV-PROOF-END"

* --- teardown: close areas, restore the x64 disk environment ----------------
WORKSPACE CLOSE
DO x64
